@0    = ~What...what happened? All I remember was you rushing at me and then nothing.~ [FHF74]
@1    = ~No...I do remember before that. She took me, didn't she? I was like her, she made me like one of her servants. And you killed me.~
@2    = ~It's all right now, Faren. I'm here to make things better.~
@3    = ~The Final Battle with Bodhi

Bodhi appeared in an ambush shortly before I reached her haven, warning me that she was aware of my pursuit and stealing from me the one person that is dearest to my heart: Faren.  Before she vanished and unleashed more of her undead creations upon me, Bodhi warned me that if I continue I will lose even more than I thought possible.  I cannot give up on the Rhynn Lanthorn... but now the life and immortal soul of the one I love is at stake, as well!~
@4    = ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

Bodhi has turned Faren into a vampire!  Or ... or very nearly.  The process may not have been completed in the short time Bodhi has had him. I will have lost him if something cannot be done.  Perhaps the elven war sage might know some way of restoration ... or Elhan...~
@5    = ~The Final Battle with Bodhi.

While I had feared for some time that Bodhi's final revenge on me would be to take away Anomen forever, it seems that the information in the lorebook was right... Amaunator's idol has restored Anomen not only to life, but has removed the vampiric curse from him, as well.~
@6    = ~I missed you like anything. I couldn't just leave you there with her.~
@7    = ~I'm not sure I want you back in my company, Faren. It was so painful to go through that.~
@8    = ~I'd...like to believe that's true. Ugh, my head's killing me - everything still feels so fuzzy, and not in the good way...~
@9    = ~Thanks. I appreciate you reviving me - I really do.~
@10   = ~Fine, if it's too upsetting to have me around I'll find my own way out of this cursed place!~
@11   = ~Listen, I think we should just get out of here. Everything bad seems to happen in this place. We can talk about it...later. Yeah, later would be good.~
@12   = ~Okay, see you around. I'll head over to Trademeet, and you can come over if you need me.~ [FHF75]
@13   = ~All right. I'll see you in Vyatri's inn.~
@14   = ~No, I'd prefer you to just wait here.~
@15   = ~Never mind, I'd like you to stay with me for now.~
@16   = ~That suits me. See you around, and have fun.~
@17   = ~All right, then, see you around. Come by if you need me, but I'm not sure I want to hang around here forever.~
@18   = ~That suits me fine. I don't want to get itchy feet waiting around for something to happen.~
@19   = ~Ah, good to see you again. What's up?~ [FHF76]
@20   = ~Faren, would you be interested in joining me once more?~
@21   = ~Good to see you too. Well, I'll be on my way, now.~
@22   = ~Are you kidding? I've been cooling my heels far too long to pass up that offer.~
@23   = ~Yeah, see you around. If you need me for anything, just come by.~
@24   = ~I just don't feel right travelling with you anymore. We're not a good mix.~
